OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FDr Emma meets a man with a strange
OL,7,     Flooking lump on his arm. There's
OL,8,     Fan odd ear lump for Dr Magnus,
OL,9,     Fexploding head cysts for Dr Adil
OL,10,     Fand a large leg lump on a dance
OL,11,     Fteacher for Dr Dev.
OL,12,G0000 Killer at the Crime Scene
OL,13,     FA university lecturer's murder,
OL,14,     Fstabbed to death in a park, marks
OL,15,     Fthe start of a killer's reign of
OL,16,     Fterror as more stabbings follow,
OL,17,     Fwith authorities scrambling to
OL,18,     Fkeep up.
