OL,5,G0100 Cold Case Killers
OL,6,     FInvestigating the murders of Samo
OL,7,     FPaul and Tracey Turner which,
OL,8,     Fdespite similarities, are not
OL,9,     Finitially connected. But Chief
OL,10,     FConstable Mick Creedon believes
OL,11,     Fit's the work of one man.
OL,12,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FAfter a quiet start to the day,
OL,14,     Fthe staff at Barnsley casualty
OL,15,     Ftreat John who has hit is head
OL,16,     Ffalling at home and seven month
OL,17,     Fold Elisa is treated in
OL,18,     Fpaediatrics.
